#17205
Before the Farmhouse~
In front of you is the doorway to a small farmhouse, it seems quite old but
well maintained. A path heads south towards the farm gates, there is a gate to
the west which leads into a paddock in which there are animals grazing, and to 
the east there is a gap in the fence providing entry into the wheatfields. 
~
