#17280
The Master Bedroom~
In this room you see a beautifully crafted four-poster bed. There is a chest of
drawers next to which is a full length, ornate mirror. It seems like this farm 
must be making a little bit of a profit by the value of the exquisite furniture
within this room. A door leads west into the hall and there is another leading 
north, probably into an en suite.
~
